<title>GERMANY: BSHG 1996 net profit 11.4 mln DM.</title>
<headline>BSHG 1996 net profit 11.4 mln DM.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   111.4   vs 88.4</p>
<p>    Group sales				  8774    vs 7743</p>
<p>	Non-German share in pct		56	vs 48</p>
<p>    Group pretax profit			209.9   vs 200.5</p>
<p>    Group workforce (Dec 31)		 31,742  vs 27,625</p>
<p>NOTE - Household appliances maker Bosch-Siemens Hausgeraete GmbH, a 50-50 joint venture of Siemens AG and Bosch, said it aimed for further improvement in 1997 profit. Sales in the first four months rose six percent to about three billion marks, and operating profit was above planned levels, the company said.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
